msgid "GNOME Remote Desktop's own daemon listens on every network; install wayland-vnc-grd to control this"
msgstr "Daemon-ka GNOME Deskitoobka Fog laftiisu wuxuu dhegaystaa shabakad kasta; ku rakib wayland-vnc-grd si aad tan u xakameyso"

