#: src/wayland_vnc/settings_app.py
msgid "General"
msgstr "Guud"

#: src/wayland_vnc/settings_app.py
msgid "In RealVNC Viewer, add a connection to one of these. They work while local network access is on, for any device on the same network. Do not forward the port from the Internet."
msgstr "RealVNC Viewer dhexdiisa, ku dar xiriir mid ka mid ah cinwaannadan. Way shaqeeyaan inta gelitaanka shabakadda maxalliga ah uu shidan yahay, qalab kasta oo isla shabakadda ku jira. Ha ka gudbin dekedda Internetka."

